Description: Logitech Spotlight presenter controls for GNOME Wayland
 Projecteur supports Logitech Spotlight presentation remotes over USB and
 Bluetooth. This edition includes GTK 4 preferences and a GNOME Shell
 extension for a spotlight, pointer and magnifier on Wayland.

